// BGXAI 040 - solely visible status above the hero on existing F toggle.
// Does not replace EPS, BGX38 or BGX39. Must be installed AFTER BGX39.
BACKUP ~BGX40/backup~
AUTHOR ~BGXAI original EET extension~
VERSION ~0.3.10-guard-mode-feedback~
BEGIN ~BGXAI 040 - Show guard ON/OFF after F key~
REQUIRE_PREDICATE GAME_IS ~eet~ ~EET is required~
REQUIRE_PREDICATE FILE_EXISTS_IN_GAME ~BDDEFAI.BCS~ ~BDDEFAI.BCS required~
EXTEND_TOP ~BDDEFAI.BCS~ ~BGX40/toggle_feedback.baf~ USING ~BGX40/lang/ru_ru/feedback.tra~
